{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/USAttyEssayli/status/2112767396478140722","id":"2112767396478140722","text":"At least 20,000 noncitizens are registered to vote in California, not 28. The 28 were just those arrested yesterday. This does not mean the other 19,972 are lawful voters. \n\nThe arrests prove our list is accurate and that noncitizens are actually voting. Our goal is to prevent California from counting the ballots of noncitizens, not to arrest all 20k on the list.","raw_text":{"text":"At least 20,000 noncitizens are registered to vote in California, not 28. The 28 were just those arrested yesterday. This does not mean the other 19,972 are lawful voters. \n\nThe arrests prove our list is accurate and that noncitizens are actually voting. Our goal is to prevent California from counting the ballots of noncitizens, not to arrest all 20k on the list.","display_text_range":[0,365],"facets":[]},"author":{"screen_name":"USAttyEssayli","url":"https://x.com/USAttyEssayli","id":"1914737178279862272","followers":90888,"following":123,"likes":601,"media_count":106,"name":"F.A. United States Attorney Bill Essayli","description":"Official account of Bill Essayli, First Assistant U.S. Attorney for the Central District of California. Privacy policy: http://justice.gov/doj/privacy-policy","raw_description":{"text":"Official account of Bill Essayli, First Assistant U.S. Attorney for the Central District of California. Privacy policy: https://t.co/JFEUpNXpzz","facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[120,143],"original":"https://t.co/JFEUpNXpzz","replacement":"http://justice.gov/doj/privacy-policy","display":"justice.gov/doj/privacy-po…"}]},"location":"Los Angeles, CA","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1914737178279862272/1745344602","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1914737861733023744/8N1CE0Cx_200x200.jpg","joined":"Tue Apr 22 17:46:47 +0000 2025","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://www.justice.gov/usao-cdca","displ